 "title": "Call Out Manipulation Tactics to Disarm Them",
 "topic": "communication",
 "summary": "The creator claims that calling out a manipulation tactic the moment it starts completely strips it of its power. By verbally pointing out or complimenting the technique being used, you bring their unconscious tactic into conscious awareness.",
 "key_points": [
  "Call out the script or tactic right away the moment it starts.",
  "If someone is trying to get sensitive information, you can say: 'Wow, you've got a very good technique for getting information out of people. I can tell you're very well trained.'",
  "Calling attention to a tactic being done takes the power away from that tactic completely.",
  "If someone gives a very hard handshake to act like an alpha male, you can say: 'Wow, that's a really powerful handshake. I read online that that's like an alpha male move that only alpha males do.'",
  "Calling it out makes everything they were doing unconsciously now conscious."
 ],
 "content": "Comment FREE and Chase’s free human behavior training will be sent to you. Chase Hughes teaches human behavior, influence, and behavioral profiling built from two decades of military and intelligence experience. Follow @chasehughesclips for more. If someone's trying to get sensitive information out of me, I would call out the script right away. So the moment that it started, if I knew like you and I were talking and you were getting trying to get sensitive information out of me, the first thing I might say is like, 'Wow, you've got a very- and I'll compliment your technique. You've got a very good technique for getting information out of people. That's- that you're- I can tell that you're very well trained.' When you call attention to a tactic being done, it takes the power away from that tactic completely. So like if somebody shakes your hand really hard and they're trying to be like super like pretend alpha male, just calling attention to that takes all the power out of it. So like they shake your hand and you're like, 'Wow, that's a really powerful handshake. I read online that that's like an alpha male move, that only alpha males do that.' But you're kind of- you're kind of complimenting them in a way where they're like, 'Oh shit, like all everything that I was doing unconsciously is now conscious.'",
